1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,370
Who is the strongest Hindu god?

2
00:00:02,390 --> 00:00:05,560
Here are five you never want to stand against.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,860
Number five: Hanuman.

4
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:13,260
When Lakshmana lay dying, Hanuman flew to the Himalayas for one healing herb.

5
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:18,030
He couldn't find it, so he tore off the whole mountain and carried it back.

6
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:21,800
Number four: Indra, king of the heavens.

7
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:25,010
The serpent Vritra swallowed the world's rivers.

8
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:30,190
Indra struck him down with the Vajra, his thunderbolt, and set the waters free.

9
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:32,370
Number three: Durga.

10
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:36,720
The buffalo demon Mahishasura could not be killed by any god.

11
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:40,070
So the gods poured their power into one warrior.

12
00:00:40,090 --> 00:00:43,320
Ten arms, ten weapons, riding a lion.

13
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:44,920
She ended him.

14
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:48,040
Number two: Vishnu, the preserver.

15
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:52,560
As the dwarf Vamana, he asked a demon king for three steps of land.

16
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:58,150
Then he grew until his three steps covered the earth, the sky, and everything beyond.

17
00:00:58,760 --> 00:01:02,040
And number one: Shiva, the destroyer.

18
00:01:02,060 --> 00:01:06,640
One glance from his third eye burned the god of desire to ash.

19
00:01:06,660 --> 00:01:10,380
And when the universe ends, it ends in his dance.

20
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:16,730
To many devotees, Shiva, Vishnu or the Goddess is the supreme power above all.

21
00:01:16,750 --> 00:01:19,550
Who's your number one?
